                            <h2 class="has-anim" data-stagger="0.02" data-duration=".75" data-delay=".1"
                                data-animation="charsUp">
                                Be bold.
                            </h2>

                        </div>
                        <!--/Text Wrapper-->

                    </div>
                    <!--/Column-->

                    <!--Column-->
                    <div class="c-col-8">

                        <!--Text Wrapper-->
                        <div class="text-wrapper">

                            <h5 style="color: rgba(25,27,29,.6)" class="has-anim" data-stagger="0.02" data-duration="1"
                                data-delay=".1" data-animation="wordsUp">
                                Our slogan, "Be bold," encapsulates both our mission and a life philosophy. It's a call
                                to push boundaries, challenge norms, and dare greatly in our art and beyond. To be bold
                                means creating work that demands attention and provokes thought, but it's also a
                                reminder to step out of our comfort zones in life. It encourages us to voice meaningful
                                opinions, stand firm in our convictions, and strive for our best selves with the boldest
                                effort.
                            </h5>

                        </div>
                        <!--/Text Wrapper-->

                    </div>
                    <!--/Column-->

                </div>
                <!--/Wrapper-->

            </div>
